OL,3,AGTA 6 hacker pleads guilty after
OL,4,Arelease from secure hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Kurtaj pleaded guilty at
OL,7,FWoolwich Crown Court to the Rockstar
OL,8,FGames hack and a handful of others
OL,9,Fwhich he carried out when he was 16 and
OL,10,F17 years old with the hacking gang
OL,11,FLapsus$.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
